"entity": {
"name": "IHS Holding Ltd.",
"description": "IHS Holding Ltd. provides mobile telecommunications infrastructure services. It operates through the following geographical segments: Nigeria, Sub-Saharan Africa (SSA), Middle East and North Africa (MENA), Latin America(Latam), and Other. The SSA segment operates in Cameroon, C\u00f4te d'Ivoire, Rwanda and Zambia. The Latam segment consists of Brazil, Colombia and Peru. The MENA segment focuses in Kuwait and Egypt operations. The company was founded by Issam Darwish, William S. Saad, and Mohamad Darwish in 2001 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.",
